OL,3,AGrowers going head-to-head at national
OL,4,Agiant veg competition after
OL,5,Aexceptionally hot summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritain's biggest vegetables are being
OL,8,Fjudged at the National Giant Vegetables
OL,9,FChampionship in Malvern - here's how
OL,10,Fthey're weighed
OL,12,FFrom the heaviest pumpkin to the
OL,13,Flongest cucumber, 169 growers are
OL,14,Fcompeting across 33 categories
OL,16,FThis year's competition comes after the
OL,17,FUK's hottest summer on record, with the
OL,18,FNational Farmers' Union warning the
OL,19,Fweather has created "significant
OL,20,Fchallenges" for farmers
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
