OL,3,AGrowers going head-to-head at national
OL,4,Agiant veg competition after
OL,5,Aexceptionally hot summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne hopeful grower Derek Hulme says
OL,8,Fthis summer's heatwaves have "played
OL,9,Fhavoc" with his veg. Another, Tim
OL,10,FSaint, tells us he was tending to his
OL,11,Fgiant pumpkin at 05:30 BST before work
OL,12,Fand well into the evening
OL,14,FSeven Guinness World Records were set
OL,15,Fat the veg competition in 2025,
OL,16,Fincluding the longest aubergine at 49cm
OL,17,F(19.3 inches)
